msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:180
msgid ""
"To start, create a new Windows VM in vCenter using a base version of your"
" selected Windows build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:182
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:188
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:218
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:253
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:281
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:326
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:435
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:458
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:479
#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:574
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:183
msgid ""
"It's recommended to make the VMDK drive as small as possible for your "
"purposes as this generally speeds cloning and deploy times. Morpheus "
"provisioning and post-deploy scripts allow to to expand the drive to any "
"size that you need."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:185
msgid ""
"Once the VM is created, ensure VMware Tools is installed on the operating"
" system. This will ensure the virtual machine can communicate correctly "
"with vCenter but also if the cloud was configured to use ``RPC MODE`` of "
"``Vmware Tools``, and the |morpheus| agent is not installed, |morpheus| "
"can communicate with the virtual machine directly for tasks and other "
"processes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:189
msgid ""
"If the cloud was configured to use ``RPC MODE`` of ``SSH/WinRM``, it will"
" be necessary to configure WinRM on the virtual machine.  Ensure WinRM is"
" allowed from your Morpheus appliance through the local Windows firewall."
"  Also, run the following command to enable WinRM in the guest: ``winrm "
"quickconfig``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:192
msgid ""
"Next, install .NET 4.5.2 or higher as a `requirement "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/functionality/agent/agentInstallation.html"
"#agent-install-requirements>`_ for the Morpheus agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:194
msgid ""
"Finally, choose a method that will be used to customize the operating "
"system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:196
msgid "Guest Customization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:197
msgid "Sysprep"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:198
msgid "Cloudbase-Init"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:200
msgid "**Using Guest Customization (Recommended)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:202
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can utilize the vCenter guest customizations feature, creating"
" its own customization specification and applying it at deployment.  "
"There are no other changes needed in the guest operating system when "
"using this method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:204
msgid "Turn off the virtual machine and convert it to a template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:206
msgid ""
"Refresh your cloud (|InfClo| > Click Cloud > :guilabel:`Refresh` > "
"Short).  Once the Virtual Image has been synced into "
":menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`, edit it and ensure **VMware "
"Guest Customization?** is checked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:208
msgid "**Using Windows Sysprep**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:210
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can inject an unattend file via CD-ROM to override the default"
" sysprep process when preparing a virtual machine.  Run the following "
"command from the guest operating system to sysprep the operating system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:212
msgid "``C:\\Windows\\System32\\sysprep /oobe /generalize /shutdown``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:214
msgid ""
"The unattend file created on the virtual machine can be ignored, no "
"changes will be needed.  Once the virtual machine has completed shutting "
"down, convert it to a template."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:216
msgid ""
"Refresh your cloud (|InfClo| > Click Cloud > :guilabel:`Refresh` > "
"Short).  Once the Virtual Image has been synced into "
":menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`, edit it and ensure "
"**Sysprepped/Generalized Image?** is checked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:218
msgid ""
"If **VMware Guest Customization?** is enabled on the virtual image or if "
"using static IP addresses or IP pools when provisioning, ensure a Sysprep"
" has not been performed in the guest. In such cases, a guest "
"customization will always be performed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:220
msgid "**Using Cloudbase-init**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:222
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:223
msgid ""
"Some admins may struggle with using Cloudbase-Init, especially if they "
"are not familiar with cloud-init (used in Linux).  It is recommended to "
"use either **Guest Customization** or **Windows Sysprep** if the admins "
"are more famililar with those tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:225
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can inject a cloud-init file via CD-ROM to override the "
"default sysprep process when preparing a virtual machine, if the "
"Cloudbase-Init service is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:227
msgid ""
"Download Cloudbase-Init from `https://cloudbase.it "
"<https://cloudbase.it>`_ for your appropriate architecture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/guides/vmware_guide.rst:229
msgid ""
"Run the installer and keep the default settings.  Below is an example of "
"the final settings page:"
msgstr ""

